' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/mapper/session/RuntimeSessionMapper.xml listCommittedEvents.
' Pending implementation: direct Session reads without resolving active_leaf_id.
' Design reason: user approved ordinary pages without cross-request snapshots.
' Existing integer page shape is retained: default 50, max 200, events/nextPage.
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam maxMessageSize 190
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
}
title Pending implementation Event History: Read, Append, Read Again
actor "Internal caller" as C
control "History service" as Q
database "Session / Event store" as D
participant "Execution appender" as A
== 1. Read the first page ==
C -> Q : List events: page 1, limit 50
Q -> Q : Normalize and validate page / limit / offset
break Invalid query
  Q --> C : INVALID_EVENT_LIST_QUERY
end
group One consistent read
  Q -> D : Check Session access and projection integrity
  break Session missing or access revoked
    D --> Q : Not readable
    Q --> C : Error; no stale access reuse
  end
  Q -> D : Read complete events by session_id / event_seq\nOffset 0, limit + 1
  D --> Q : Ordered records
end
Q -> Q : Build shared complete projection\nSet nextPage from extra record
Q --> C : ResultBean(events, nextPage)
== 2. Append without a cross-page snapshot ==
A -> D : Commit new complete events at the tail
D --> A : Committed
== 3. Recheck and read the next page ==
C -> Q : List events: page 2, same limit
Q -> Q : Validate page / limit / offset
group New consistent read
  Q -> D : Recheck Session access and projection integrity
  break Session missing or access revoked
    D --> Q : Not readable
    Q --> C : Error; no stale access reuse
  end
  Q -> D : Read complete events by session_id / event_seq\nOffset 50, limit + 1
  D --> Q : Ordered records, including newer tail
end
Q --> C : ResultBean(events, nextPage)
legend bottom left
Valid empty page: events=[], nextPage=null. Null is not execution completion.
Rebuild from page 1 after access, retention, or page-size changes.
No automatic change detection or POST replay. sourceEventId is not a cursor.
endlegend
@enduml
